WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.380
Today's chef's
special entree is...uh?

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.030
Is something wrong, President?

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.100
Uh? Well, I was thinking that we
haven't done this for a long time.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.430
What?

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:26.380
I mean, eat dinner
together like this.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.610
Yeah, that's very true, President.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.380
It's OK to call me papa now.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.620
Oh, that's right. I don't come to
this kind of place so often, so l'm nervous.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:37.800
You're a funny girl.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.770
That's everything. Please take
extra care during this operation.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.230
I'll be awaiting good news.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.690
Yes, I will certainly
bring good news.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.010
Aika and Michikusa are late.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.970
Rion...

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.160
What are your plans
for the future?

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.090
What?

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:05.850
Are you going to continue
working as a salvager?

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:09.890
What are you talking about?
Of course I will.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:12.920
I don't think that's a good idea.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:13.980
What?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.200
Why not, Papa?

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.520
The world has become a
better place in recent days.

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:22.030
It's time for you to plan
your future more seriously.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:26.710
A salvager is somebody who searches
for an inheritance from the past.

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:29.010
People shouldn't do that
kind of work forever.

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:31.900
Rion, you should find
something better...

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.780
No way!
That's not true!

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.780
I don't have any intention
of quitting thisjob!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.940
I like being a salvager!

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:42.980
I'll continue doing this
job with you and Aika!

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.150
I'll never quit!

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.290
Rion...

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.790
President.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:53.400
Oh, Michikusa, you're here.
Uh? Where is Aika?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.820
She said she couldn't make it.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.470
I see.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:23.120
No way!
lt's a joke, right?

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.750
Now l'm very irritated.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:29.730
I worked for 4 hours on this
and was just about to finish.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:32.520
Oh, I hate this.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.770
Start decorating the summer night sky.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:58.860
Diamonds started twinkling in a galaxy.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:04.740
I threw myself in a time and wandered.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:11.080
The smile made me warm up after a hard journey.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:23.720
You pretended like you didn't know that.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:29.060
If it's an endless dream...

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:35.730
I'll fight to make it shine.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:47.740
I'll expect again and again to realize...

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:55.830
I'm only looking at my precious future.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.220
Thank you for the dinner.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.270
Sure, see you later.
Be careful going home!

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.710
Good night.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:53.700
Night.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.290
It was delicious.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.720
Aika should have skipped
work and joined us.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:03.650
I guess so.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:13.200
That's...

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:16.880
Wait!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:21.840
Rion!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.720
Papa!

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.270
President.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.970
Three, two, one!

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.570
W...what?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.680
Is this?

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.240
Our office is gone.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:23.110
Ah, Rion, here you are.

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:27.780
What happened to the office?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:36.260
Hey, what happened?

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.440
Can't you see?
It collapsed.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:41.790
The Delmos blew it up.

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.780
Oh, is that so?

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:48.450
I was just surprised,
because I came here,...

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.650
and I saw the office,
and it's gone.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.420
By the way, where's the boss?

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:57.660
In the hospital.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:58.910
What?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.650
The Delmos hit him with a car
now he's badly injured.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.710
It'll take him four months to heal.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.040
Oh, no. Then, what about Aika?

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:21.830
Don't be so sad!
You shouldn't be like this, Rion.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:26.340
She's dead now.
We can't do anything about it.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.630
She's not coming back
even if you cry for her.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.760
Who said she's dead?
You bastard!!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.180
But...

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:40.040
She's not dead!
Aika wouldn't die this way!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.690
I'm sure she is still alive!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.050
Ouch.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.900
Where are you going, Rion?

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.400
I'm going to the Delmo's hideout!

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.320
I'll find out where it is
and break into it.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:07.170
I must have revenge
for Aika and Papa.

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.340
I'll see you later.

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:14.240
Did you forget something, Rion?

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.440
You're coming with me!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:21.640
Ouch! That hurts, Rion.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.610
Aika!

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.530
Tell me this is a lie!

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.080
Aika!

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:34.470
Ah, how long are you
going to do this?

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.220
But...

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:40.400
I know...l know. I understand
you were serious about her.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.950
But crying doesn't change anything.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.380
Act like a man!

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.530
Shut up!

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:51.210
You'll never understand that my
sadness is deeper than the ocean.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.590
Aika! My honey!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.120
Oh, really? l'm sorry.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.310
Even if your body is grown up,
your mind is still like a baby.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.890
Why didn't this happen to the
old man instead of her?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.600
Aika!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.190
I should have asked her
out to dinner at least once.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.930
Hey, walk by yourself.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:18.510
Can I politely refuse to take revenge?

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:20.890
Hey Rion! Rion!

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.870
What did you say?!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.940
Are you really going to get revenge?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.920
You idiot! What are you thinking?

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.630
I'm not an idiot!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.200
How can I just take this
shit and do nothing?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:36.180
Hey, can you give me
some help? Please!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:37.390
I refuse!

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:42.120
Why should I poke my nose into
another company's problems?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.040
I feel sorry about Aika,
and your office.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:48.840
You have my sympathies,
but this and that are different.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.360
What if something bad were
to happen to you, too?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:56.880
Don't make your father
worried or even more sad!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.430
That's right.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.270
No!

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:00.640
I said l'll do it, so I will!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:04.500
I won't listen to you no matter
how you try to stop me!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:04.870
Fine!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:09.070
You don't have to help me!
l'll get revenge for Aika by myself!

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:12.630
I'm sure Papa will
understand my feelings, too.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.840
Hey! Why don't you say
something to her, Gusto?

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:22.510
All right! I understand.
I'll help you, Rion!

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:32.620
Bandara got angry and left.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.160
Is it OK?

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:37.860
It's nothing!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.140
I'm the one who
decided to help her.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.680
Now you guys can
completely rely on me.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.370
Then, let's find out the
Delmo's hideout!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.370
Gusto, can you do that?

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.020
What's wrong, Gusto?

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:56.490
Well, managing intelligence data
was all handled by Bandara.

00:10:56.490 --> 00:11:00.220
I have no idea how
to do such things, l'm sorry.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:04.680
What?! How can I rely on such
an empty brain like you?!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.210
Don't say mean things, Rion.

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:13.410
Oh, by the way, I know somebody who's
very familiar with that kind of information.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:18.680
She may be able to find
the Delmo's hideout.

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:23.770
She might even be
able to give us help.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:28.620
She told me that she was aformer
A-class special secret agent.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:31.890
Former A-class
special secret agent?

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.130
Her name is Maypia.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.660
Oh, long time no see, both of you.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:41.950
What?

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:45.810
Oh, you guys knew each other?

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.770
Yeah, a little bit.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.270
What can I get for you?

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:56.940
That's it.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:03.160
Inuboe lsland.
People call it Lighthouse lsland.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.380
I can finally take revenge for Aika.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:13.220
By the way, couldn't you
find a better ship than this?

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.500
Don't be silly!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.200
This kind of ship
is less suspicious than others.

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.700
Hey, Michikusa, what are you doing?

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:25.500
A hovercraft is approaching us,
so l'm saying hello to them.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:25.970
See.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:26.970
What?

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:30.770
Hey!

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.730
They're Delmos.

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:34.940
Oh, no!

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.190
One more from over there.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:37.470
Hey!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:40.840
What do you mean this boat
is less suspicious? Liar!

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.130
Shut up! Shut up!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:44.940
This is no time to fight.
They're surrounding us.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:51.660
We knew this might happen,
so we were watching you guys.

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.810
I want all of you to die here.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.580
Prepare to die!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.590
Target is that pleasure boat
about four hundred meters ahead.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.890
Faster! Faster!
They're gaining on us!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:14.940
Of course they are.
Their ship is much faster than this.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:07.780
Ouch!

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:11.520
I'm still alive.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:13.060
Was I saved?

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.110
So was everybody else.

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:17.930
But why?

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.690
What happened...

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.490
to these guys?

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:45.820
I found something useful.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.850
Oh, this is perfect for battle.

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.260
How do I look?

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.070
Huh?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.020
Do I look cute this time?

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:56.010
Michikusa, you are...

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:58.880
You are such an idiot!

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.170
Damn it! Let's go everybody!

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:08.720
What's the matter?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:09.680
There's an intruder.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:10.590
What kind?

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.110
We are confirming that now.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:18.960
This is gonna be our
avenging battle for Aika!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.190
Let's destroy everything, Rion!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:21.730
Yes.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.240
Oops!

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.510
Damn it!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:36.740
I've got it.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:51.340
Intruders are moving from F block
to the third floor of E block.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.160
All right.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:56.330
Close gates number 5, 7, 8 & 16!
We'll lure them into one area.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.210
Roger!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:00.690
I'll seal gates number 5,7,8 & 16.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.070
Huh?

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.200
Michikusa, what are you doing?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:16.960
Hurry!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.390
Oh, yes.

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:26.420
They're trapped.

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:31.720
What?

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:46.900
What?

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:48.860
What's wrong?

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.680
Perhaps we were...

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.790
Yes, you guys were tricked by us.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.200
Is that you?

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:04.210
Oh it's you two,
Miss Aika's appendix.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.480
What do you mean by appendix?!

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.080
But, she's got us pegged.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:10.800
Don't agree with her!

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:15.280
Were you guys planning
revenge for Aika Sumeragi?

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.510
Are those two your bodyguards?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.430
We're...

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.570
So what?

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:22.350
Come on and fight with me!

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:26.490
Well, unfortunately, I can't.

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:28.190
Your opponents for this time are...

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:30.900
We are your opponents!!

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.570
Golden Delmo Sania!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.700
Golden Delmo Tonia!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:37.070
Here we go!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:37.910
Come on!

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:16.860
Don't think we're so easy!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:20.550
You guys are not even a threat
anymore since Aika Sumeragi is gone.

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.580
Now l'm pissed!

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:27.960
What is this?

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:30.280
Commander...

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.480
Are you all right?
l'll call for help right now.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:36.000
B...blue haired woman....

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.150
Blue hair?

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:40.700
Commander!

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:46.600
What should we do
about these people?

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.310
Considering what they did,
they have to pay dearly.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.730
What? Why don't you kill
us if you want to?!

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:57.820
Then I will make
your wish come true.

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:02.140
I didn't wish it.
I have no intention to die yet.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.350
Oh, me neither.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.620
Hey!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.830
Don't worry, l'll kill
everybody together.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.600
Rion...

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.510
Miss Aika must be waiting eagerly
for everybody tojoin her.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:25.520
Too bad!
But l'm not dead yet.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:28.850
Who?!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:33.020
Aika, I knew you were alive!

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:34.770
Huh? Aika?

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:38.190
I'm sorry I made you worry, Rion.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.570
Damn you!
Aika Sumeragi!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.740
How many times
have you disturbed us?

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.450
But this time it ends.

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:49.350
That's exactly what I intend to do.
Let's end this here.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.060
Let me take care of this, please.

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.110
Aika!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.330
Huh?

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:56.500
This...

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:00.530
I'm glad.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:02.320
This was my favorite one.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.810
Thank you, Rion.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.140
Tonia!

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:43.510
Tonia!

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:44.930
Rie.

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:46.430
Sania.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.360
Take this!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.110
Aika!

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:07.620
It can't be!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.970
No way!

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.130
Aika!

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:32.810
Huh?

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.070
Commander.

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:51.790
We'll abandon this base
and destroy it.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.790
But, commander, if we
lose the base, how do we...?

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:58.250
We can't hurt our comrades anymore.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:03.280
I'm ordering to end the
operation against Aika Sumeragi.

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:06.180
I also prohibit any further contact
with Aika Sumeragi from now on.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:07.790
Commander!

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:09.930
Are you sure you want to do this?

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.310
We will start over
from the beginning.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:15.840
But when the time comes...

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:18.860
I will settle this, myself.

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:22.190
Attention!
We're abandoning this base!

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:25.570
All personnel will evacuate
this base immediately!

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:26.780
Yes Sir!

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:29.700
I'm glad. I'm really glad.

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:32.970
Hey! Who is that?

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:57.880
I've gone back to
living in a trailer again.

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:00.560
There is nothing we can do about it.

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:02.070
It's just that way.

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:05.030
But our President seems like he's
recovering quicker than expected.

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:07.990
Let's work hard together.

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:11.470
I know it but...

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:17.500
Oh, Rion, l'll help you if you
are worrying about something.

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:20.790
What are you talking about?
lt's you! You!

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:22.420
Ah, my kappa doll.

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:25.190
Do you ever make time
to work a little?!

00:23:25.820 --> 00:23:27.970
Oh, ouch! Please don't do that!

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:29.240
It hurts.

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:30.890
Stop it! Both of you.

00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:37.520
Hey! l'll see you later.

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:46.520
Huh?
